---

<Layout
	title="Sports · streaming shell | Erika Train"
	description="Static sports-style viewing shell on Train: hero live tile, stats rail, and shelf placeholders — wire real playback from a companion app or pipeline origin."
	pageClass="page-sports"
	eyebrow="Sports"
	subtitle="Layout-only surface inspired by major sports streamers; GitHub Pages serves HTML and CSS, not a broadcast encoder."
>
	<section class="container sports-shell">
		<header class="sports-hero card">
			<div class="sports-hero-genres">
				<div class="sports-genre-strip">
					<div class="sports-genre-strip-head">
						<span class="sports-genre-strip-label mono small">Sports</span>
						<a
							class="sports-genre-kalshi mono small"
							href={kalshiSportsUrl}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Kalshi · all sports
						</a>
					</div>
					<div
						class="sports-genre-scroll"
						role="tablist"
						aria-label="Sports genres and leagues"
					>
						{
							sportsGenres.map((g) => (
								<button
									type="button"
									class="sports-genre-tab"
									role="tab"
									id={`genre-tab-${g.id}`}
									data-genre-tab={g.id}
									aria-selected={g.id === 'all' ? 'true' : 'false'}
									tabindex={g.id === 'all' ? 0 : -1}
								>
									{g.label}
								</button>
							))
						}
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="sports-genre-strip">
					<div class="sports-genre-strip-head">
						<span class="sports-genre-strip-label mono small">Prediction markets</span>
						<span class="sports-genre-strip-hint muted small">Beyond sports · same contract UX</span>
					</div>
					<div
						class="sports-genre-scroll"
						role="tablist"
						aria-label="Prediction market categories"
					>
						{
							marketGenres.map((g) => (
								<button
									type="button"
									class="sports-genre-tab sports-genre-tab--markets"
									role="tab"
									id={`genre-tab-${g.id}`}
									data-genre-tab={g.id}
									aria-selected="false"
									tabindex={-1}
								>
									{g.label}
								</button>
							))
						}
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="sports-genre-readout mono small" id="sports-genre-readout" aria-live="polite">
					Sports · All sports
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="sports-hero-body">
				<div class="sports-hero-copy">
					<p class="sports-kicker mono">Train · static shell</p>
					<h1 class="sports-title">Sports viewing layout</h1>
					<p class="muted sports-lead">
						This route holds the <strong>grid, rails, and typography</strong> for a premium live sports experience.
						Use the genre tabs above for sportsbooks-style navigation (aligned with discovery patterns like{' '}
						<a href={kalshiSportsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kalshi all sports</a>
						) plus full prediction-market verticals. Attach a real player from your Game <code>/live</code> desk, a
						WebRTC/HLS workpad, or another origin in a new tab or iframe once you deploy that stack outside Pages.
					</p>
					<div class="sports-hero-actions">
						{
							gameLiveUrl ? (
								<a class="button" href={gameLiveUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
									Open Game live desk
								</a>
							) : null
						}
						<a class="button-secondary" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}predictions/`}>
							Predictions + field viz
						</a>
						<a
							class="button-secondary"
							href="https://ballerleague.us/en"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Baller League (sample feed)
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="sports-hero-stage card sports-live-card" aria-label="Main live tile placeholder">
					<span class="sports-live-badge">LIVE</span>
					<div class="sports-live-inner">
